{"4402300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Derby Life: Ranch & Race", "steam_appid": 4402300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5074680], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/fccfe1b9566cd971a9ef45883b1b1f71.webp?t=1787724958\" width=1170 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/5341af2c2d8dba6d175018611769f161.avif?t=1787724958\" width=1170 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family's once-famous ranch has fallen into decline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's on you to raise the ultimate racehorse, outrun a greedy rival, and bring the glory back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/383e014d0b838fae17e55143cd2e29bc.poster.avif?t=1787724958\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/383e014d0b838fae17e55143cd2e29bc.webm?t=1787724958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/383e014d0b838fae17e55143cd2e29bc.mp4?t=1787724958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/175e17810a6ca471e5437f2dc37849a5.avif?t=1787724958\" width=1170 height=131 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>You're not in the stands. You're in the saddle.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•     Ride as jockey yourself — or hire a pro and call the shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•     Read the track and your rivals to find the winning line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•     Race the World Tour across iconic cities worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•     Climb the global rankings to the Hall of Fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/dd91346b423994e2e17826edce2758e6.poster.avif?t=1787724958\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/dd91346b423994e2e17826edce2758e6.webm?t=1787724958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/dd91346b423994e2e17826edce2758e6.mp4?t=1787724958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4402300/extras/014a1cd22faa8727e0fb4975c94ffb58.avif?t=1787724958\" width=1170 height=131 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Your ranch, your rules — explore a living open world.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•     Roam open pastures, deep forests, and sunlit beaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•     Raise sheep and cattle — and fend off wild predators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•     Explore hidden forests and dig up buried treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•     Cast a line off the pier at sunset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor